Package: singlepress
Title: Compressed Sparse Matrix I/O for Single-Cell Genomics
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Zach", "DeBruine", , "debruinz@gvsu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Read and write .1pz sparse matrix files with VOCSC + byte-split +
    bit-plane + bitmap pre-filter + zstd/LZ4 compression achieving 13x compression
    ratios and 4000+ MB/s decode speed. Integrates with Seurat, SingleCellExperiment,
    and standard Matrix/dgCMatrix sparse formats. Supports embedded cell/gene/study
    metadata (AnnData-compatible).
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
SystemRequirements: zstd (>= 1.4), C++17
Imports:
    Matrix,
    methods,
    Rcpp
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp
Suggests:
    Seurat,
    SingleCellExperiment,
    SummarizedExperiment,
    S4Vectors,
    scater,
    scran,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://singlet-ai.github.io/singlepress/
BugReports: https://github.com/Singlet-AI/singlepress/issues
